{"t":"000810.KS","n":"Samsung Fire & Marine Insurance Co., Ltd.","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":511000.0,"chg":29000.0,"chgPct":0.06017,"prev":482000.0,"dayH":513000.0,"dayL":489000.0,"w52H":757000.0,"w52L":419000.0,"vol":73668,"avgVol":174850,"mcap":21722363330560,"pe":null,"fpe":6.9,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":19500.0,"divY":0.0405,"beta":null,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Financial Services","sKo":"금융 서비스","i":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","iKo":"보험 - 재산 및 사상자","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.samsungfire.com","sum":"Samsung Fire & Marine Insurance Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, provides non-life insurance products and services in South Korea, China, Indonesia, Vietnam, Singapore, the United States, and the United Kingdom. The company offers automobile insurance, long-term damage insurance, personal pensions, and retirement pensions, as well as claim adjustment, agency, and insurance consulting services. It also provides general insurance that covers risks related to business management, personal property, and body, including fire, marine, technology, liability, injury, and disease. The company was founded in 1952 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","sumKo":"삼성화재해상보험주식회사는 자회사들과 함께 한국, 중국, 인도네시아, 베트남, 싱가포르, 미국, 영국에서 손해보험 상품과 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 자동차보험, 장기손해보험, 개인연금, 퇴직연금 등 보험금 조정, 대리, 보험 컨설팅 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 또한 화재, 해상, 기술, 책임, 부상, 질병 등 경영, 개인 재산, 신체와 관련된 위험을 보장하는 일반 보험도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1952년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 서울에 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":18684900000000,"ni":1283731640000},{"y":2023,"rev":0,"ni":1818434000000},{"y":2024,"rev":0,"ni":2047781250000},{"y":2025,"rev":19136809630000,"ni":2018286150000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":4856246800000,"ni":234731430000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":4743313510000,"ni":634671000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":0,"ni":738735000000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":5052499520000,"ni":493171000000}],"eps":[{"q":"3Q2025","act":11981.0,"est":13746.